      "placement": {
        "prefer": "below",
        "auto_flip": true,
        "gap": 12
      },
      "nav": {
        "buttons": [
          {
            "role": "skip",
            "label": "Skip"
          },
          {
            "role": "back",
            "label": "Back"
          },
          {
            "role": "advance",
            "label": "Next"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "more",
      "content": {
        "content_kind": "text",
        "payload": {
          "title": "Point at … and it opens",
          "body": "It stays open while you move into it, and pressing it keeps it open. The pane's own actions are one row of icons; Draw, Tabs, Move to layer, Pane mode and Layouts open beside the menu, and on a phone they open in place with Back."
